{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07676","headline":"湖中旅泊寄阎九司户防 · 孟浩然","name":"湖中旅泊寄阎九司户防","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桂水通百越，扁舟期晓发。\n荆云蔽三巴，夕望不见家。\n襄王梦行雨，才子谪长沙。\n长沙饶瘴疠，胡爲苦留滞。\n久别思款颜，承欢怀接袂。\n接袂杳无由，徒增旅泊愁。\n清猿不可听，沿月下湘流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07676.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07676","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}